  "description": "The Evolution of Alpe d'Huez\nAlpe d’Huez is more than a climb in Le Tour: Helicopters, police escorts, blue smoke, screaming face-painters, and a crowd of 300,000 cycling fans guarantee that every visit to the most famous summit in Le Tour will result in history being rewritten.\nThis unmistakable marriage of suffering, spectacle, and sportsmanship is woven into every thread of every Alpe d’Huez frame we make. To ride the TIME Alpe d’Huez disc is to enjoy something that eludes description and can’t be duplicated.\nThe TIME Alpe d’Huez is the Ultimate Road Bike, and it’s TIME to write your own story.\nReady to Paint\nTime framesets can be purchased unpainted, prepped and sanded, and with all hardware. Deliver the Ready to Paint frameset to your chosen paint shop to create the TIME of your dreams!",
